Exactly. Affordance before category.

The human sees:

\text{newspaper}=\text{information/media}

The squirrel may encounter the same physical object primarily through completely different actionable properties:

\text{newspaper}
\rightarrow
\begin{cases}
\text{shreddable}\\
\text{carryable}\\
\text{insulating}\\
\text{soft}\\
\text{nest material}\\
\text{barrier}
